  "Thank you, truly. Duitful is one person's work, and you just made it a little more possible. Your purchase keeps it in the App Store and Play Store, and it tells me the work is worth doing.": "Terima kasih, sungguh. Duitful dibina oleh seorang sahaja, dan anda baru sahaja membantu ia terus hidup. Pembelian anda membolehkan ia kekal di App Store dan Play Store, dan memberitahu saya kerja ini berbaloi.",
  "My promise back: no ads, no selling your data, no subscription. Your money stays yours, and so does everything you write here.": "Janji saya: tiada iklan, tiada jual data anda, tiada langganan. Wang anda tetap milik anda, begitu juga semua yang anda tulis di sini.",
