  "The monthly payments don't outpace the interest. The Debts tab shows what it takes.": "Bayaran bulanan tidak melebihi faedah. Tab Hutang menunjukkan apa yang diperlukan.",
  "The monthly payments don't outpace the balance — add what you pay each month. The Debts tab shows what it takes.": "Bayaran bulanan tidak mengurangkan baki — masukkan berapa anda bayar setiap bulan. Tab Hutang menunjukkan apa yang diperlukan.",
